#: ../../tools/medlineplus_tools.rst:32 4630405762c64f6089c567bc8868de33
msgid ""
"**Description**: Look up corresponding MedlinePlus page information "
"through MedlinePlus Connect Web Service using clinical/drug/test codes "
"(such as ICD-10 CM, RXCUI, LOINC, etc.), supports JSON or XML format "
"return."
msgstr ""
"**描述**：通过 MedlinePlus Connect Web 服务使用临床/药物/测试代码（如 ICD-10 CM、RXCUI、LOINC "
"等）查询对应的 MedlinePlus 页面信息，支持 JSON 或 XML 格式返回。"

#: ../../tools/medlineplus_tools.rst:34 ../../tools/medlineplus_tools.rst:78
#: ../../tools/medlineplus_tools.rst:112 ../../tools/medlineplus_tools.rst:146
