msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr "**参数：**"

#: ../../tools/medlineplus_tools.rst:36 18224d421f244bc0ad6784c1054bbe17
msgid ""
"``cs`` (string) (required) Code system OID, e.g., ICD-10 "
"CM=2.16.840.1.113883.6.90, RXCUI=2.16.840.1.113883.6.88, "
"LOINC=2.16.840.1.113883.6.1, etc."
msgstr ""
"``cs``（字符串）（必填）代码系统OID，例如：ICD-10 "
"CM=2.16.840.1.113883.6.90，RXCUI=2.16.840.1.113883.6.88，LOINC=2.16.840.1.113883.6.1，等等。"

#: ../../tools/medlineplus_tools.rst:39 35731547d0e145409a210002590ec218
msgid ""
"``c`` (string) (required) Specific code value to query, e.g., \"E11.9\" "
"(ICD-10 CM) or \"637188\" (RXCUI)."
msgstr "``c``（字符串）（必填）要查询的特定代码值，例如“E11.9”（ICD-10 CM）或“637188”（RXCUI）。"

#: ../../tools/medlineplus_tools.rst:42 f3684d85ae234a778845111c1cc7c1af
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``dn`` (string) (optional) Optional, descriptive name (English) "
"corresponding to the code, for drugs can fill in \"Chantix 0.5 MG Oral "
"Tablet\", can improve matching accuracy."
msgstr "`dn`（字符串）（可选）可选项，对应代码的描述性名称（英文）。对于药物，可以填写“Chantix 0.5 MG 口服片剂”，可提高匹配准确性。"

#: ../../tools/medlineplus_tools.rst:45 54591b1ec5b743fc80c6f9c65ccd8329
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``language`` (string) (optional) Return information language, \"en\" for "
"English, \"es\" for Spanish, default \"en\"."
msgstr "``language``（字符串）（可选）返回信息的语言，“en”表示英语，“es”表示西班牙语，默认值为“en”。"

#: ../../tools/medlineplus_tools.rst:48 4557a675ba5641c0a1cf0b12e756e506
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``format`` (string) (optional) Return format, options "
"\"application/json\" or \"text/xml\", default \"application/json\"."
msgstr "``format``（字符串）（可选）返回格式，可选项为 \"json\" 或 \"xml\"，默认值为 \"json\"。"

