#: ../../tools/medlineplus_tools.rst:173 bc4c3f737b7d48a0b45a3cca23d6af9a
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search for relevant information in MedlinePlus Web "
"Service by keyword across health topics or other sub-libraries (such as "
"drugs, genetics, etc.)."
msgstr "**描述**：通过关键词在MedlinePlus网络服务中搜索相关信息，涵盖健康主题或其他子库（如药物、遗传学等）。"

#: ../../tools/medlineplus_tools.rst:177 598a65b39b734004bd55ca05e38708ce
msgid ""
"``term`` (string) (required) Search keyword, e.g., \"diabetes\", needs to"
" be URL encoded before passing."
msgstr "``term``（字符串）（必填）搜索关键词，例如“diabetes”，传递前需进行URL编码。"

#: ../../tools/medlineplus_tools.rst:180 02483f2eede741748ef0f8e296afb0f4
msgid ""
"``db`` (string) (required) Specify the database to search, e.g., "
"healthTopics (English health topics), healthTopicsSpanish (Spanish health"
" topics), drugs (English drugs), etc."
msgstr ""
"``db``（字符串）（必填）指定要搜索的数据库，例如 "
"healthTopics（英文健康主题）、healthTopicsSpanish（西班牙文健康主题）、drugs（英文药物）等。"

#: ../../tools/medlineplus_tools.rst:183 d88ea263e5144a9d89f875aab0c04259
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``rettype`` (string) (optional) Result return format, options: brief "
"(concise information, default), topic (detailed XML record), all "
"(includes all available information)."
msgstr ""
"``rettype``（字符串）（可选）结果返回格式，选项包括：brief（简洁信息，默认）、topic（详细的 XML "
"记录）、all（包含所有可用信息）。"

